Dekhne ke liye reply karein!', '"[\"customer_name\", \"season\", \"design_count\"]"', 'hi', 'approved', '2026-03-10 02:08:52.233797+00', '2026-03-10 02:08:52.233797+00'),
	('c172cdc5-366a-4f1a-a5b5-71f41701e48a', 'welcome_hi', 'नमस्ते! मैं Shreerang Trendz का बॉट हूँ। आप कौन सा कपड़ा देखना चाहेंगे? 1 Mill Print/Solid Dyed 2 Digital Print 3 Embroidery/Schiffli', NULL, 'hi', 'active', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00'),
	('b0c0391c-8b3c-4726-a053-91c4f2e2205b', 'welcome_gu', 'નમસ્તે! Shreerang Trendz માં સ્વાગત. કયો ફેબ્રિક જોઈએ? 1 Mill Print 2 Digital Print 3 Embroidery/Schiffli', NULL, 'gu', 'active', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00'),
	('7436759b-7c8d-45b0-9b80-21a206d33004', 'welcome_en', 'Hello! Welcome to Shreerang Trendz. Which fabric category? 1 Mill Print/Solid Dyed 2 Digital Print 3 Embroidery/Schiffli', NULL, 'en', 'active', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00'),
	('987c64c1-f589-408b-86e4-e14cc7c9464e', 'followup_hi', 'नमस्ते! क्या आपने डिज़ाइन देखे? कोई सवाल हो तो बताइए।', NULL, 'hi', 'active', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00'),
	('8bd62e42-f656-408a-a902-0b0c4b0a22fc', 'followup_gu', 'નમસ્તે! ડિઝાઇન જોઈ? કોઈ સવાલ હોય તો જણાવો.', NULL, 'gu', 'active', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00'),
	('bb4930d4-9782-41b9-8f4d-e9064f2a965a', 'price_quote_hi', '{{fabric}} ની કિંમત ₹{{price}}/meter છે (Lump 50m+)', NULL, 'hi', 'active', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00'),
	('901eb3d0-c398-4771-a8ef-df48a672cfab', 'order_confirm_hi', 'ऑर्डर कन्फर्म! Design: {{design}} Qty: {{qty}}m. हमारी टीम जल्द संपर्क करेगी।', NULL, 'hi', 'active', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00'),
	('c6615f12-ea22-43f4-a354-e8b385e453c3', 'price_ask_admin', 'PRICE APPROVAL: Customer {{customer}} asking {{fabric}}. Qty: {{qty_type}}. Suggested: {{price}}. Reply CONFIRM or PRICE_XX', NULL, 'en', 'active', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00', '2026-03-10 10:47:32.46017+00');


